{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just another rhythm game, you are basically a <strong>walking 8-note instrument</strong> that you can <strong>customize</strong> and use to perform one of the two Mulong rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selve is a <strong>music adventure</strong> where you take on the role of a young member of the Mulong tribe from Selve Island. The people of this tribe have amazing <strong>musical powers</strong> thanks to their connection with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Summon Mud Creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/Selve_MulMud_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take some <strong><i>Mul</i></strong> <i><strong>mud</strong></i> and sing freely to it, the mud will come to life, its abilities will depend on the characteristics of the melody you have played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Sacred Melodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/Selve_SacredMelody_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mulong have created sacred melodies that do not require the use of <i><strong>Mul mud</strong></i>, but must be played perfectly to  properly work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bend wills with your melodies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/SelveTrailer_DialogueChoice_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some characters will not cooperate with your mission, will you manipulate them using your musical powers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/SelveTrailer_SynthSound_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your voice in this game is a very customizable synthesizer, if you change different proportions of your body, your sound will be different.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571850?t=1752117990","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/bf05aec9817cacc09131f7c99b054d38bf84f881/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752117990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/297bf81524918880fcd69951aba606215470bc26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752117990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/297bf81524918880fcd69951aba606215470bc26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752117990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just another rhythm game, you are basically a <strong>walking 8-note instrument</strong> that you can <strong>customize</strong> and use to perform one of the two Mulong rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selve is a <strong>music adventure</strong> where you take on the role of a young member of the Mulong tribe from Selve Island. The people of this tribe have amazing <strong>musical powers</strong> thanks to their connection with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Summon Mud Creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/Selve_MulMud_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take some <strong><i>Mul</i></strong> <i><strong>mud</strong></i> and sing freely to it, the mud will come to life, its abilities will depend on the characteristics of the melody you have played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Sacred Melodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/Selve_SacredMelody_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mulong have created sacred melodies that do not require the use of <i><strong>Mul mud</strong></i>, but must be played perfectly to  properly work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bend wills with your melodies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/SelveTrailer_DialogueChoice_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some characters will not cooperate with your mission, will you manipulate them using your musical powers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/SelveTrailer_SynthSound_opt.gif?t=1752117990\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your voice in this game is a very customizable synthesizer, if you change different proportions of your body, your sound will be different.</p>","developers":["Nico Frois"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/92e2443ced2d481ed87ab2c1290545419b16ea9f/header.jpg?t=1752117990","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131159,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131159/movie480.mp4?t=1752117986","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131159/movie_max.mp4?t=1752117986"},"name":"Piano mechanics","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131159/ca3f7ec19b206ea02670d31965c833c5f566d727/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752117986","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131159/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752117986","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131159/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752117986"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257127026,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127026/movie480.mp4?t=1752117989","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127026/movie_max.mp4?t=1752117989"},"name":"First gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127026/ca3f7ec19b206ea02670d31965c833c5f566d727/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752117989","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127026/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752117989","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127026/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752117989"}}],"name":"Selve","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li